{"unit_id":"re-ITRT__dsh-skill-mcp-panel#card-1","repo":"re-ITRT/dsh-skill-mcp-panel","commit":"654f6d7b5b1c603a6f13c8c5372fb8dbd7bd49c0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-mcp-panel 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的技能与 MCP 管理插件，通过侧边栏打开管理页面，并由宿主服务提供技能目录、MCP 配置和工具状态。用户可以查看技能详情、启用或停用技能、删除并恢复技能，也可以查看、创建、编辑、启用或删除 MCP 服务器配置。页面还支持打开技能或服务器所在目录，并以中英文界面及宿主主题显示。适合需要在 DSH 中集中管理技能和 MCP 连接的用户；需由 DSH 提供相应注册表和服务，不要求插件自带 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:118-154","lib/client.js:1457-1487"]}
{"unit_id":"re-ITRT__dsh-skill-mcp-panel#card-2","repo":"re-ITRT/dsh-skill-mcp-panel","commit":"654f6d7b5b1c603a6f13c8c5372fb8dbd7bd49c0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-skill-mcp-panel adds a DSH Web sidebar to manage skills and MCP servers. Users can inspect, enable, disable, delete, and restore skills, and create, edit, enable, or remove MCP entries. It shows registered tools and follows the host theme. DSH must provide the host services.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:118-154","lib/client.js:1457-1487"]}
